+## [v0.1.11-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> Experimental candidate; no confirmed E2LB connection fix.
+> 实验候选版，E2LB 连接尚未证实修复。
+
+### English
+- Observe the actual availability packet's cumulative ACK, without changing the message or retransmission policy.
+- Stop an E2LB detect-only startup before speculative endpoint discovery.
+- Preserve matching partial DETECT markers and distinguish closed links from timeouts.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 跟踪启动消息的实际累计 ACK，不改变报文和重传策略。
+- E2LB 仅收到探测信号时停止本轮，不进入无依据的端点发现。
+- 保留匹配的分片探测标记，区分断链和超时。
 
